            "notes": "[Pocket Projector](item_5c95fa4f-6f53-494e-9b4a-a7e2766cb1e8) is a pretty bad power, but it helps slightly with survival so we take it. It also happens to proc a 2nd instance of  [Tesla Field](item_68f73d99-6d07-40f5-ad28-0c69f45487c7)  and  [Unstable Prototype](item_3c4fac62-90b1-49f8-8602-ba89abcbf437) which can be pretty strong.\n\nIf the enemy tank is being a nightmare for your team or you guys are just struggling to get kills in general, take  [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) instead of  [Unstable Prototype](item_3c4fac62-90b1-49f8-8602-ba89abcbf437)",
