        {
            "id": "2b80f1f2-5f95-4677-a6a2-1a594d212d25",
            "build_id": "6fb48444-91fe-4d00-bd52-fab583fa813b",
            "round_number": 7,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-29T00:31:17.708201+00:00",
            "notes": "I don't have strong feelings on power for this round.  [Lunar Leap](item_dd41728d-7997-487f-93f5-859b3e9d0c84) feels like it's got a lot of potential since you can just leap nonstop and forever be generating 5% of your HP as overhealth.  [Surge Protector](item_5a653c7a-e156-449c-905b-83a1a54e7f93) has potential if your team needs some help living, but it doesn't do a hell of a lot.\n\nUltimately though,  [Moon Landing](item_cc4f210b-31e1-47b2-8400-325afcc4892b) is probably the most health per second that you can generate. Hitting 2 target with jump pack damage is giving you 14% of your health every 2.5 seconds and you can basically sustain forever on point.\n\nWe do have  [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f)  but in a pinch you can Primal and never die with a 1 second leap cooldown and ~2k health...you can self heal around 250hp a second during Primal by just leaping on people over and over. That's not even including  [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) which also heals you 60hp a second during Primal.",
